{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/411272-dark-ages-let-the-sickness-begin-vampire-promethean-europe-s-black-death","id":411272,"title":"[DARK AGES] Let the Sickness Begin: Vampire & Promethean - Europe's Black Death","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-19T03:59:45-08:00","id":411272,"title":"[DARK AGES] Let the Sickness Begin: Vampire & Promethean - Europe's Black Death","content":"So... we're almost past 82500 $ and the next step is truly exciting, with a three options, double themed chapter. We'll have to fight against <b>Changeling &amp; Geist:</b> Three Kingdoms China (~240) and <b>M</b><b><b>a</b>ge &amp; Mummy:</b> French Revolution (~1790s), beautiful perspectives on their own rights, but i think we can pull this one. I mean, the explosion most devastating sickness in Europe? I can't wait to see a writing on that. The Morbus will be holding their breaths (oh, well, maybe not so much). <br /> <br /> I only regret one thing, though. I was kinda hoping to see a Werewolf-Vampire Dark Age, even more so taking into account that werewolf still has no other chapter than the basic. It is a shame it won't be this :S","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{