ew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T03:59:17-08:00","id":412615,"title":"","content":"I'm surprised by this powerful Changeling/Geist lead, didn't think they would get the votes so completely on their side... and in fact this would be the third Changeling chapter achieved by contributor rewards! Hard and popular beasties <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T07:24:18-08:00","id":412722,"title":"","content":"Probably more IP spoofing. Oh well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5092-quazar87","name":"Quazar87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5092_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T09:57:41-08:00","id":412909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quazar87</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/411272-dark-ages-let-the-sickness-begin-vampire-promethean-europe-s-black-death?p=412722#post412722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably more IP spoofing. Oh well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or maybe that Changeling is very, very popular, plus people want to see content that isn't European or North American? Don't get me wrong, I want to see this era too, and have suggested it multiple times, but China has just as much history as Europe, and hasn't even been touch before this. Please don't place the blame on people cheating when all three of the suggested eras are worth of inclusion on their own. <br /> <br /> @Rose: Here's a question/suggestion. I know its been brought up in multiple places that some people would like to see a Dark Eras 2 come out at some point, due to the strength of aforementioned eras that aren't going to make it. I also know that part of the idea with the polls was to gauge the interest that people had in each era. Here's the thing though, with only one vote, we can't really express how close many of these choice are for us. I've lost track of the number of people who've said they wish they could vote for all three. <br /> <br /> Would it be possible to include a poll after the kickstarter closes, either independently or in the Kickstater post-survey, that asks if people would be interested in seeing the eras that didn't make if, and only if, a second book should be made? Case and point. I want all three of the eras in this round. I'm honestly crushed by the fact that not all three of them are going to be included, especially since I've been calling for Vampire/Promethean Black Death. I think there is more than enough creative juice left in the tank for a second book at some point in the distant future. By collecting data on if people would like to see the eras that didn't make it in a future book, at least I'd rest easy knowing that OP has the market research data telling them if they would be viable somewhere down the road, either as Dark Eras 2 or as part of some other supplement. <br /> <br /> Sorry if that rambled too much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T10:00:59-08:00","id":412912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/411272-dark-ages-let-the-sickness-begin-vampire-promethean-europe-s-black-death?p=412909#post412909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-snip-</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with this fine sir or madam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T19:05:01-08:00","id":413596,"title":"","content":"To be honest, I think a Dark Eras 2 is contingent entirely on sales. Does the Kickstarter break records and the books and pdfs sell thousands of copies? Dark Eras 2: Darker Eras is much more viable and an easier book to pitch to CCP. I know the developers (and writers) are really sad some of their suggestions and favourites didn't make the cut; Matt's been pretty vocal about still wanting to do his Innocents: Blitz era. So, if you want more Dark Eras, be sure to buy the pdf and get more people to do the same.<br /> <br /> This is pretty useless advice to give to anyone who is a big enough World of Darkness fan to post on these threads or even these forums, of course. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T10:07:38-07:00","id":451665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illuminated Minutia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/360610-wod-dark-eras-was-ages-kickstarter-questions?p=431260#post431260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, so it seems like everyone has decided on what they want to do and is sending out their requests. (Barring the Mysterious Final Backer, ofc)<br /> <br /> <u>Save-An-Era</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Claire Wick - <b>Vampire/Promethean in the Black Death</b></span><br /> Illuminated - <b>Mummy/Mage in the </b><b>Mutapa Empire</b><br /> <br /> <u>Expand-An-Era (10K)</u><br /> Reseru - <b>??? in </b><b>Ruins of Empire</b><br /> FallenEco - <b>Dave's Expansion Megapack + ??? in To the Strongest</b><br /> DannyK - <b>Demons in the Aztec Empire</b><br /> <br /> <u>Expand-An-Era (5K)</u><br /> Retias - <b>Werewolves in Neolithic Mage</b><br /> Second Chances - <b>First Nations Hunters in Doubting Souls</b><br /> Praetorian (RPGnet) - <b>Viking Era Expansion (feat. Geists)</b><br /> <br /> So if all this goes through I'd say its safe to say that Tokugawa will most likely go to the Hunters. (Again, barring the Mysterious Final Backer adding a Hunter era.)</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems that at last we have the Era, mates! So i just wanted to write here in order to thank Claire Wick. Thank you very much! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, <br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=125\" data-tempid=\"temp_125_1426957532072_227\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T10:56:25-07:00","id":451756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eremite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/411272-dark-ages-let-the-sickness-begin-vampire-promethean-europe-s-black-death?p=413596#post413596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does the Kickstarter break records and the books and pdfs sell thousands of copies? Dark Eras 2: Darker Eras is much more viable and an easier book to pitch to CCP.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it was on a Monday Meeting that Rich Thomas said that the Kickstarters don't actually contain much in the way of profits, with pretty much all the money going to the developers, printing and so on, and stretch goals to the writers of those.<br /> <br /> But having things like Dark Eras would give them an alternative to putting out a new game line every year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":